    "detailed_description": "<strong>You're welcome to play and stream live!</strong><br>2D food action shooting game! Aim for the main dish!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>Eggs stand up against giant food to become the main dish.<br>The stage is set with various dining options such as sushi, grilled meat, fried foods, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stage Phase</h2>Earn points to increase your life!<br>You won't get a GAME OVER no matter how many times you get hit, so go all out!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/2a6ebe5f58c01f30fa9a7344efca6bba.poster.avif?t=1723122718\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/2a6ebe5f58c01f30fa9a7344efca6bba.webm?t=1723122718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/2a6ebe5f58c01f30fa9a7344efca6bba.mp4?t=1723122718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Phase</h2>It's a battle against a giant boss!<br>Be careful, as the life you earned in the stage will gradually decrease.<br>If your life runs out, it's GAME OVER! You'll have to start over from the beginning!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/b07749bbae951279e0b3f21fe2c4e04c.poster.avif?t=1723122718\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/b07749bbae951279e0b3f21fe2c4e04c.webm?t=1723122718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/b07749bbae951279e0b3f21fe2c4e04c.mp4?t=1723122718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Internet Multiplayer Support</h2>Battle against distant players!<br>Using items will put the first-place player at a disadvantage.<br>If you want to cooperate, you'll have to avoid nuisance items!<br>If you want to compete, grab as many nuisance items as you can!<br><strong>When you land the final blow on the giant boss, you'll be the winner and the main dish!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/2206b8ea3a8041157a8be7183fc95a9c.poster.avif?t=1723122718\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/2206b8ea3a8041157a8be7183fc95a9c.webm?t=1723122718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896530/extras/2206b8ea3a8041157a8be7183fc95a9c.mp4?t=1723122718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player Mode Available</h2>You can also challenge the giant boss alone.<br>However, nuisance items will always come your way!<br>For players who want to test their skills!<br><br><strong>&quot;Streaming is always welcome! Please include the game's URL in the description.&quot;</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Various keyboards<br></li><li>Various gamepads<br></li><li>PS4 controller (not tested)<br></li><li>XBOX controller<br></li><li>SwitchPro Controller</li></ul>",
